	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nuBifzuafWo1e27z_",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 18, DX 13, IQ 4, HT 13, HP 18, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 13, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 12, DODGE 9, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "njxW7-hFSuC-63HUP",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 34 (offense 21, protection 13), threat tier standard, appearing 4."
		},
		{
			"id": "nyUy8E-lT7hdRqoNk",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/dire-wolf.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nbprScyiOnBUjKHfc",
			"text": "Independent build total: 10 points of racial traits plus 12 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-58yDA-Mcq31huil",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Dire Wolf (SRD 5.1); Dire Wolf (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nMPsTEqTyDYsT5QKt",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nHuQSaHvDmq4tXNhS",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6, 12 at a sprint (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "nMe8d9uBGBY8Hok3e",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "noR_YCpgWKvSejD_O",
			"text": "The pack is the threat. Run these as a coordinated group, not as four separate rolls."
		},
		{
